Suppose that the activation function is $f(z) = \tanh(z)$.
Give an upper bound on $|dh_m/ dh_1|$ in terms of $u$ and $m$.

Hint: the derivative of $\tanh$ is bounded by 1 (to see this, google ``plot tanh(x) from -2 to 2'').

